The projection of $\mathbf{i} = (1, 0)$ onto the $y$-axis is:
\[P(\mathbf{i}) = \boxed{\mathbf{j}} \cdot \mathbf{i} \times \boxed{1} = 0 \times 1 + 1 \times 1 = \boxed{1} \text{ (unitless)} \]
